 how='<p>Safety standard ISO 10218 was revised in 2025: the old collaborative-robot rules (ISO/TS 15066) were folded in, and "collaborative" is now a property of the <i>application</i>, not the robot.</p><div class="tbl"><table><tr><th>Humanoid</th><th>Status, 2026</th></tr><tr><td>Boston Dynamics Atlas (electric)</td><td>Production version shown at CES 2026; units committed to Hyundai and Google DeepMind <span class="chip claim">claim</span></td></tr><tr><td>Figure 03</td><td>Reported working at BMW Spartanburg from mid-2026 <span class="chip claim">reported</span></td></tr><tr><td>Tesla Optimus V3</td><td>Production start targeted for mid-2026 <span class="chip claim">claim</span></td></tr><tr><td>Unitree G1, H2</td><td>Sold commercially <span class="chip ok">production</span></td></tr><tr><td>1X NEO</td><td>Consumer pre-orders from Oct 2025, shipping "2026" <span class="chip claim">claim</span></td></tr></table></div>',
