 how='<p>A physics engine (MuJoCo, NVIDIA Isaac Sim) generates sensor data. <b>Domain randomisation</b> varies textures, lighting and physics so that what the robot learns transfers to the real world (Tobin et al., 2017). The difference that remains is the <b>sim-to-real gap</b>.</p>',
